    {
      "id": "claim_15530ca278604bbaa640fd0ad2c5ab84",
      "statement": "The wiki-update generation model pin moved from claude-sonnet-4-6 to claude-sonnet-5 in feature 075 (2026-09-21) purely for cost: same vendor, credential, workflow and Deep Agents caching middleware, only the id changed. Sonnet 5 lists at $2/$10 per MTok versus Sonnet 4.6's $3/$15, with cache reads at $0.20/MTok versus $0.30; generation was ~53% of a measured $74.89 model bill over the 30 days to 2026-09-20 and already ~92% cache reads, so the cached-read rate — not list input price — decided it, yielding roughly a 33% reduction (~$1.72 to ~$1.15 per run-day).",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://docs/runbooks/wiki-maintenance.md#L122-L127",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:70b6eba935539df50331c0875ac2e05cb9a8320458d691be44da34cc12fde9d7:"
