    {
      "id": "claim_d340754bb13d4b6d87e0f781174a242f",
      "statement": "OpenWiki sends no temperature parameter to the model, which is why bumping the wiki-maintain pin to claude-sonnet-5 was safe where an equivalent bump broke the agent gateway: the gateway sent temperature unconditionally and Sonnet 5 / Opus 5 reject that parameter with HTTP 400. A model id is therefore only a drop-in for the sampling parameters the caller actually sends, and must be re-checked if OpenWiki ever starts sending them.",
