      "id": "claim_7534fdb6d2bc4502afeeaa2bc5d496be",
      "statement": "V12 drift detection is warn-only and deliberately excluded as an input to planSlices in scripts/wiki-maintain.mjs, which decomposes work only from paths changed since the run-record marker plus the carried-forward backlog; consequently a concept whose source changed after the marker passed it is not automatically re-planned, a gap tracked as #526, compounded by #587 (a refresh slice verifying as noChange even when it wrote nothing for a requested page, advancing the marker past the change) and #525 (the drift-clearing sweep blocked on #587 and on canonical sources being corrected first, #588).",
